@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
title SEQ-001 — Public map, search, language and audio
footer APPROVED D-016 DEC-076 | UC-001, UC-002, UC-003, UC-004, UC-005, UC-010, UC-011

actor Tourist
participant UI
participant "Browser GPS" as GPS
participant "Local data / media" as Local
participant "POI & Content API" as POI
database "POI DB" as DB
participant "Usage Monitoring API" as Usage
Tourist -> UI: Open map / search / select POI
alt Online
 UI -> POI: Read published, non-deleted POIs
 POI -> DB: Query published revision
 DB --> POI: Public snapshot
 POI --> UI: Result or read error
else Complete offline package
 UI -> Local: Read verified English snapshot
 Local --> UI: Snapshot or missing-data error
end
opt Locate / nearby
 UI -> GPS: Request location with permission
 alt Valid fix
  GPS --> UI: Position + accuracy
  UI -> UI: Nearest <=4 within 3 km straight-line
 else Denied / unavailable
  GPS --> UI: Error
  UI -> UI: Keep map/search available
 end
end
Tourist -> UI: Play selected narration
UI -> Local: Load selected audio URL / cached English
alt Audio available
 Local --> UI: Audio
 UI -> UI: Start playback; pause keeps listening lifecycle
 opt Online telemetry
  UI -> Usage: Start / heartbeat / end by playbackId
 end
else Load fails
 UI -> UI: Show Retry; no autoplay fallback
end

@enduml
